{% extends "layouts/main.njk" %}{% block title %}附件上传结果 · OldBBS{% endblock %}{% block content %}<h1>附件上传结果</h1><p>{{ attachment.originalName }} · {{ attachment.fileSize }} bytes · SHA-256 <code>{{ attachment.sha256 }}</code></p>{% if attachment.scanStatus == 'clean' %}<p>文件通过安全检查。下载链接：<a href="/attachments/{{ attachment.id }}">/attachments/{{ attachment.id }}</a></p><p>将链接复制到 Markdown 帖子中；主题附件仍受版块读取权限限制。</p>{% elif attachment.scanStatus == 'rejected' %}<p>文件未通过安全检查，不能下载。</p>{% elif attachment.scanStatus == 'scan_failed' %}<p>安全扫描暂时无法完成。文件已隔离，不能下载；请联系管理员检查扫描服务。</p>{% else %}<p>文件仍在隔离区，完成安全扫描前不可下载。</p>{% endif %}<form method="post" action="/attachments/{{ attachment.id }}/delete"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{ csrfToken }}"><button type="submit">删除附件并释放空间</button></form><p><a href="/attachments/new">继续上传</a></p>{% endblock %}
